Passage 2. In many stressful situations, the body's responses can improve our

111
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:44,200
performance. We become more energetic, more alert, better able to take effective

112
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:50,480
action. But when stress is encountered continually, the body's reactions are more

113
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:53,420
likely The be harmful than helpful to us.

114
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:59,080
The continual speeding up of bodily reactions and the production of stress -related

115
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:03,400
hormones seem to make people more susceptible to heart disease.

116
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:08,760
And stress reactions can reduce the disease -fighting effectiveness of the body's

117
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:15,240
immune system, thereby increasing susceptibility to illnesses ranging from colds to

118
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:21,840
cancer. Stress may also contribute to disease in less direct ways, by influencing

119
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,160
moods and behavior.

120
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:29,480
People under stress may become anxious or depressed, and as a result may eat too

121
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:34,640
much or too little, have sleep difficulties, or fail to exercise.

122
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:39,920
These behavioral changes may in turn be harmful to their health.

123
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:45,900
In addition, people are more likely to pay attention to certain bodily sensations,

124
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:50,780
such as aches and pains when they are under stress, and to think that they're sick.

125
00:11:51,540 --> 00:11:56,220
If the person were not under stress, the same bodily sensations might not be

126
00:11:56,220 --> 00:12:00,520
perceived as symptoms, and the person might continue to feel well.

127
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:06,820
Some researchers have suggested that assuming the role of a sick person is one way

128
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:09,640
in which certain people try to cope with stress.

129
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:15,700
Instead of dealing with the stressful situation directly, these people fall sick.

130
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:21,480
After all, it is often more acceptable in our society to be sick and to seek medical

131
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:26,000
help than it is to admit that one cannot cope with the stresses of life.

